2026-10-24T05:52:39.4476600Z 
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4477028Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4477359Z 
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4477493Z Commands:
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4478145Z   diagnostics         Export bounded private diagnostics without changing or stopping USB devices
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4479266Z   logs                Read sanitized stored logs or authorized agent audit projections
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4480201Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4481343Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4482592Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4483815Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4485292Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4486469Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4487598Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4488779Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4490061Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4491238Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4492413Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4493538Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4494613Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4495960Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4497017Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4498317Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4499234Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-24T05:52:39.4500077Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
